  "releaseNotes": "Release Notes and Important Information\n\n## Before You Update\n- Always back up your projects BEFORE updating.\n- Review the release notes BEFORE updating.\n- Contact support if you have questions BEFORE updating.\n\n## Improvements\n1. Siticone Overlay\n- Added support to control the gap between the activity spinner and message text.\n- Added support to control whether the spinner appears before or after the text.\n- Improved centering and responsive layout so the spinner and text stay properly aligned when the target control or form is resized.\n- Improved text rendering to ensure overlay messages display fully without being cut off in supported .NET environments.",
